<title>ITALY: Gildemeister Italiana seeks Milan listing.</title>
<headline>Gildemeister Italiana seeks Milan listing.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of lathe-maker Gildemeister Italiana Spa has decided to ask Milan stock market regulator Consob for its shares to be listed on the bourse, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Gildemeister Italiana ordinary shares currently trade on the over-the-counter market and closed steady Monday at 5,230 lire. Until June this year the Bergamo-based company was owned by German group Gildemeister.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
